 the opposing team to win!\nAre you ready to become the ultimate champion?\nCome forth dragon rider, your destiny beckons!", "short_description": "Take part in Inferno Cup, the ultimate live action dragon riding sport competition. \nSoar through the skies on the back of majestic dragons to compete for glory.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://infernocupvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cyberware Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://infernocupvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7159653840816982"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001707_180952038398548_5163857428327332396_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PHt_E6GqX1QQ7kNvwHgvoHz&_nc_oc=AdmGM57ZhdMyXEand2RZz_meINGZ8GFQAPLnRsdvpbNtBKkH80981R5M1xRwm1HYenw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsxhsEYIR5WextRXtwdn9quEuXbKV8VqntBkR5iYppa5Q&oe=6999B205"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Inferno Cup (Demo)", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Adventure", "id